{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"72a79ff3399d4429b2740cc3b4b0403c54a4286cf2fcb59335b897df9ac374c0","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"bffaff9f6c850337ca4e8bcd63c29ffef7b826718c5157f7b08e0c4b6590e308","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源串 tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:834 的 MOSS_TREAD long_desc 只有 \"You lay moss where you walk.\"。译文却另外加入了多项机制：成功自行移动到新位置、缠绕苔藓、自然伤害、移动减速、可能被定身。这些内容都不在源串里。冻结证据只给出 831-837 行，也没有指定 DLC 源码位置，所以无法核验这些机制是否属实。按忠实度应译为「你走过的地方会铺上苔藓。」之类；如果要保留机制说明，需要补充施加该效果的技能和苔藓地形的源码证据。"},{"revision_key":"c000e44be5060e5d35b9f1e988549600adc0cc54b43484f8d5757bd073fcb01d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"emporium.lua:48-54 中 \"the people of the Atmos Tribe apparently wish to trust the Guard with their well-being\" 的意思是「把自身安危托付给守卫」，译文「想要用他们的全身心信任守卫们」把意思改成了全心信任。\"After over twenty years of service\" 译成「二十年的经营后」，漏掉了 over（二十多年）。"},{"revision_key":"c088cae8c5e5ace64226e24b610c9868ec4dce425a96d416c7b277713b95557d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c0e390f731e3a6021218bb66b6125843738be0a1578b1a7c987daf570448f12c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c13869e9eb1974fdb67fad268fbab49033213a95c850b91225786699484e0d84","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c1d81b80fa5c193078f1bdf229534bb0cda219b38a439c8fd4cafcfa58d2fdb8","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"orcs.lua:24-40 有四处问题。(1) 源文 \"barely concealing their distaste for us 'cowards' and 'weaklings.'\" 只是一句，译文写成「他们毫不掩饰对我们的厌恶，勉强掩饰着……鄙夷」，前后自相矛盾；后面的「每当这种矛盾爆发，我们便成了千夫所指。」在源文中不存在。(2)「我们被成为了千夫所指的对象」语法错误，应为「我们成了……」。(3) 跨条不一致：本条把 Clork Peninsula 译作「克拉克半岛」，同批 c299fd58（birth/worlds.lua:61）译作「克洛尔克半岛」。(4) \"living for countless ages alone on a mountaintop would do that to anyone\" 说的是独居山顶会让任何人变得轻浮古怪，译文「都会这么对待其他人」误解了原意。此外，\"like the Atmos could without being tethered to a pipe or hose\" 被译成暗示气之部族自己需要连接气管，与原意相悖。"},{"revision_key":"c299fd5842d19d4479567da48a61fdfa7956039712191deb938d9425a438a0c9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"birth/worlds.lua:59-61 中，第 59 行 \"The Scourge from the West is back in the west, but her legacy stays strong\" 说明 the Scourge 指一个人（西方之灾），不是一场灾难。译文「没有被这场灾难伤害」把她误读成了事件，还漏掉了 unseen（未被她发现）。另外 Clork Peninsula 在这里译作「克洛尔克半岛」，同批 c1d81b80（lore/orcs.lua）译作「克拉克半岛」，专名不一致。"},{"revision_key":"c2e4a8d74f666e577885bb45b294b1cff0aa1407415c031b3360236657554318","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c307e5b149002887d58eb35d992c990f5050e887f481d66b1cf034ff7d4f97ed","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"domestic-yeti.lua:83 中 \"It glares at you with a long trained anger\" 说的是长期训练出来的怒意，这是驯养攻击雪人的关键设定。译文「狂怒的瞪着你」漏掉了 long trained。"},{"revision_key":"c37dbbf403c249c7fd4e2b9e5692a20acb6cad65105d5b5b268bac1b06173dca","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c43a6a0caadef8a668c31cdc01b2890ee4c63798dff613401e3fb6a0ae3c7c3e","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"gem.lua:63-65 中 \"whether those tinies like it or not\" 的 tinies 指目的地太阳堡垒一方的小个子种族，是巨人对他们的蔑称。译文「不管你们这些家伙喜不喜欢」把对象改成了在听广播的议会，指代错位。"},{"revision_key":"c43ffa11d074add3bedb14ad029e43148d9b4b008d614796092b77b1d4a67a29","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c485763bb03771bf70dfb6dd46851cc0b66c37ae0f6da4a92859c00a2f8260c5","verdict":"OK"}]}